SUMMARY:Launch of Kelly Fritsch and Anne McGuire's Broken Worlds\, Disabled
  Kin - by Another Story Bookshop
LOCATION:William Doo Auditorium
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/launch-of-kelly-fritsch-and-anne-mcguires-bro
 ken-worlds-disabled-kin-tickets-1999794677714\n\nHosted by Another Story
  Bookshop (https://anotherstory.ca/home)\n\nJoin Another Story Bookshop
  and University of Minnesota Press to celebrate Broken Worlds\, Disabled
  Kin: Strategies for Collective Survival! Authors Kelly Fritsch and Anne
  McGuire argue that we live in a world broken by design: a web of systems
  that debilitate and destroy through racist and ableist infrastructural
  neglect\, socioeconomic abandonment\, and ecological negligence.
END:VEVENT
