SUMMARY:Equity & Diversity in the Context of Critical AI Literacy - by OISE
  Centre for Media\, Culture & Education
LOCATION:Online
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.oise.utoronto.ca/cmce/events/equity-diversity-context-critica
 l-ai-literacy-10-09-26-0\n\nHosted by OISE Centre for Media\, Culture &
  Education (https://www.oise.utoronto.ca/cmce)\n\nIn what ways does AI
  reproduce the inequities we already experience\, and how can we develop
  skills to recognize the ways in which AI reinscribes inequalities? This
  panel explores how Critical AI Literacy can centre Indigenous and
  equity-deserving knowledges while moving educators beyond critique toward
  refusal\, resistance\, agency\, and action. 
END:VEVENT
